 over-the-top bosses that stand in your way!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/7c987c1e41f2e141538296737b4a0973.avif?t=1772049815\" width=562 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2616540?t=1772049815","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2616540?t=1772049815","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/3c879a103c338d9993c8bccfa33574bce3ac4454/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772049815","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/3c879a103c338d9993c8bccfa33574bce3ac4454/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772049815","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4408590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a4307f3490ff0416c3b61b564f6b508b.avif?t=1772049815\" width=562 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROAK</strong> is a fast-paced <i>2D platformer</i>\u00a0with bouncy gameplay and cheeky tongue   mechanics that let you grapple, dash, and pinball through  bite-sized levels.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/